            "text": "The Bootleg Series Volume 1: The Quine Tapes by Velvet Underground, a rock music genre, was released on October, 16, 2001 by Universal Music Group and Polydor Records.The Quine Tapes was preceded by Squeeze by The Velvet Underground."
        },
        "Id2": {
            "text": "Bootleg Series Volume 1: The Quine Tapes album created by Velvet Underground with a genre rock, was preceded by the album Squeeze and recorded through Polydor Records under Universal Music Group record label released on 10-16-2001."
        },
        "Id3": {
            "text": "Music group the Velvet Underground released their Rock music album Bootleg Series Volume 1: The Quine Tapes on 2001-10-16. The album was released by record labels Polydor and Universal Music Group. It was preceded by the band\u2019s album Squeeze."
